-- =====================================================================
-- archive_photos SEED — load Naldo's 211 resolved archive photos
-- (#167 P1 slice 1). Generated from
-- docs/superpowers/specs/data/2026-07-23-resolved-photos-cumulative.csv.
--
-- One INSERT per Drive file. resolved_customer_id resolves the naming pass's
-- 8-char customer-id prefix to the full uuid via a subquery (verified 1:1
-- read-only at generate time — see the VERIFY block at the foot of this file,
-- which re-checks it at APPLY time). ON CONFLICT (drive_file_id) DO NOTHING
-- makes this idempotent — re-running never duplicates or clobbers reviewer edits.
--
-- 158 install photos -> status 'pending' (of those, 1 carry a manually
-- typed address that matched no CRM contact -> not_in_crm); 52 non-installs ->
-- 'excluded' + classification 'other'; 1 name-only (no address yet) ->
-- 'pending' + not_in_crm, name in reviewer_notes.
--
-- HOW TO APPLY: run AFTER 2026-07-23-archive-photos.sql. Paste + Run in the
-- Supabase SQL Editor, then read the VERIFY block's output. Idempotent.
-- =====================================================================

